  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">英文：</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">適用於版本 1.12.2、1.16.5、1.20.1 的沉浸式載具擴充包，新增軍事與民用裝備、汽車、飛機、直升機、摩托車、自行車，你想要的一切應有盡有！</h2><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">民用載具 &nbsp; &nbsp; <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/V27ufUNDTg0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><br><img src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cmatransportpack/screenshots\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1053/786/2024-12-31_10.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"315\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/276/1-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/279/4-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/278/3-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cmatransportpack/screenshots\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/277/2-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/286/11-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1053/790/2024-12-31_13.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"315\"><br>民用載具</span><br><br>- GAZ 31105 <br>- Volzhanin 52701 <br>- ZIL-130 - <br>Ford E系列 <br>- Hammer H2 <br>- Minsk - <br>KAMAZ消防車 - VAZ <br>-2115 - Mitsubishi Lancer Evo 10 - Mitsubishi Fuso Canter - KAMAZ 6x4低車身 - KAMAZ 6x4長車身 - KAMAZ 6x4高車身 - KAMAZ 8x8高車身 - KAMAZ 8x8短車身 - KAMAZ 4x4車身 - KAMAZ 4x4長車身 - MAZ 4x4車身 - MAZ 6x4車身 - MAZ 6x4長車身 - PAZ Vector - Nissan Primera P10 - Yenisei-950 - Don-1500B - MTZ-82.1 - MTZ-80 - HTZ-17221 - HTZ-17221-21 <span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍事載具 </span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用運輸 </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯/俄羅斯坦克</span> - KV-85 - T-34-85 - IS-2-1944 - T-62 - T-72B3 - BMP-2 - BMP-2M - BTR-80A - BTR-80 - T-72B3 - TOS-1A - 2S19 Msta-S - T-80BV - T-80BVM - T-90A - T-90M<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/284/9-png.png\" alt=\"蘇聯坦克\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/281/6-png.png\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/282/7-png.png\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/283/8-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/294/12-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/295/13-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\"><br><br></span><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯/俄羅斯運輸載具</span><br>-ZIS-5「Katysha」 <br>-ZIS-5防空炮 <br>-9K72 Elbrus <br>-BM-21「Grad」 <br>-Pantsir S1 <br>-Pantsir S1M <br>-KAMAZ 63968「Typhoon」 <br>-GAZ Tigr</p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯火炮</span><br>- ZIS-3 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國坦克</span><br>- Pz-IV <br>- Wirbelwind <br>- Sd.Kfz. 234/2 <br>- Panther G <br>- Tiger II <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國運輸載具</span><br>- Opel Blitz <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國火炮</span><br>- 7.5 cm PaK 40 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用航空器 </span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/275/image-png.png\" alt=\"軍用航空器\" width=\"561\" height=\"315\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/280/5-png.png\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍用航空器 </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘇聯/俄羅斯</span></p><p>-Su-34 <br>-Su-25「Grach」 <br>-MiG-21 <br>-MiG-23 <br>-Mi-24 <br>-Ka-52 <br>-Mi-8 <br>-Mi-8 AMTSh <br>-Mi-171Sh <br>-Pe-8 <br>-Il-2 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德國</span><br>-Ju 87 <br>-Ar 234 <br><br>槍械武器 <br><br>-AK-105 <br>-AK-105瞄準鏡 <br>-AK- <br>12 -AK-12瞄準鏡 -AKS-74U <br>-RPK <br>-74M <br>-PM <br>-PKM <br>-SVD <br>-SVD瞄準鏡 <br>-VSS <br>-VSS狙擊步槍瞄準鏡 <br>-SV-98 -SV-98瞄準鏡 <br>-RPG-7 <br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">民用航空器 </span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/638/540/2023-03-24_12.png\" alt=\"波音767\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">民用航空器</span><br><br>-波音767 <br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍艦 </span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/658/767/2023-05-08_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"297\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">軍艦 </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-俾斯麥號</span><br><br><br><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">安裝此沉浸式載具擴充包需要先安裝 </span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Immersive Transport 擴充。</span><br><br></p><p><br><br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
